{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act51side_level_act51side_01_beg","storyGroup":"act51side","storySort":2,"storyDependence":"act51side_level_act51side_st01","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"PA-1","storyName":"“卡托加区欢迎你”","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"在一年一度的冬季舞会上，娜塔莉娅见识到了形形色色的贵族，并独自收集情报。在这些贵族为政治吵得不可开交时，前来抗议的学生们包围了舞会厅。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act51side/level_act51side_01_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act51side_01","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":0,"next":2,"characters":["早露","殷勤的近侍","贵族女性","沃伦佐娃夫人","真理","古米","烈夏","担忧的贵族","骄傲的贵族","？？？","巴普洛维奇","殷勤的声音","严肃的贵族","傲慢的贵族","贵族A","贵族B"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"stopmusic","id":1},{"type":"dialog","id":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"charslot","id":5},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_bg_72_g7_ballroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":6},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.1","fillto":"0.1","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":7},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.1","fillto":"0.1","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":8},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_highheeledshoe_carpet_fts","volume":"0","channel":"f","loop":"true","id":9},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.8","channel":"f","fadetime":"2","id":10},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"一路走来，走廊上都只点着蜡烛。连皇宫也减少了电的用度吗？这真是......","id":11},{"type":"dialogue","name":"殷勤的近侍","text":"为将储存的能源节省起来分给民众，陛下是这样说的。","id":12},{"type":"dialogue","name":"殷勤的近侍","text":"不过请您放心，这只是陛下出于勤俭节约的提议，宫中的生活并没有受到影响，今年的冬季舞会也是如此。","id":13},{"type":"dialogue","name":"殷勤的近侍","text":"我们就要到了。罗斯托娃小姐，请让我为您取下大衣。","id":14},{"type":"dialog","id":15},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"f","fadetime":"1","id":16},{"type":"delay","time":"1.2","id":17},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothtrailground","id":18},{"type":"delay","time":"2.8","id":19},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_highheeledshoe_carpet_fts","volume":"0.8","id":20},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"感谢您的帮助。","id":21},{"type":"dialogue","name":"殷勤的近侍","text":"职责所在。","id":22},{"type":"dialog","id":23},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_ouat_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":24,"musicid":0},{"type":"bg","id":25,"from":"1","to":"0.2","duration":"4","block":"false"},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":26},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":27},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2165_1#4$1","duration":"1","block":"true","id":28},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":29},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"好亮......","id":30,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fd/Avg_avg_npc_2165_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1982_1#1$1","id":31},{"type":"dialogue","name":"殷勤的近侍","text":"那么，我就退下了。祝您愉快。","id":32,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/58/Avg_avg_npc_1982_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":33},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"60,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1","id":34},{"type":"delay","time":"1.1","id":35},{"type":"charslot","id":36},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2165_1#3$1","posfrom":"-35,0","posto":"35,0","duration":"1","id":37},{"type":"delay","time":"1.1","id":38},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"烦请稍等，我还有一些问题——","id":39,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_avg_npc_2165_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":40},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2173_1#1$1","id":41},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贵族女性","text":"——娜塔申卡？","id":42,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":43},{"type":"charslot","id":44},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2165_1#6$1","id":45},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"嗯？您是......","id":46,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f5/Avg_avg_npc_2165_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"沃伦佐娃伯爵夫人？","id":47,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f5/Avg_avg_npc_2165_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":48},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walkfast","id":49},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2173_1#1$1","posfrom":"-80,0","posto":"110,0","duration":"0.8","id":50},{"type":"delay","time":"0.8","id":51},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":52},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"陛下在上......可怜的孩子，真的是你。","id":53,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"n","id":54},{"type":"text","text":"稍远处的贵妇人看见了早露，立即快步迎了上来，惊喜的神情几乎让她有失贵族仪态。","id":55},{"type":"text","text":"她紧紧握住了早露的小臂，像是在努力确认眼前的女孩并不是幻影。","id":56},{"type":"dialog","id":57},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2173_1#1$1","afrom":"1","ato":"1","posfrom":"110,0","posto":"20,0","duration":"1.8","id":58},{"type":"delay","time":"1.8","id":59},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":60},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"娜塔申卡......实在是太好了，我还能见到你......健康活着的你。","id":61,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"我听说了发生在切尔诺伯格的事情，我的心简直都要碎了。我实在是不明白，命运为何要让如此善良的一家人遭受这样可怕的事......","id":62,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2165_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":63},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"承蒙您的挂念，虽说损失了些产业，但比起全家人的安危来说，那些已经不值一提了......总之，都过去了。","id":64,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_2165_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":65},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"是的，是的，快让我们忘了那些不好的回忆吧......你不知道，我在收到你的信，得知你要来圣骏堡的时候有多高兴。","id":66,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"真希望你能够在这过上一段平静的日子，可如你所见，现在的圣骏堡也不是一个安稳平静的地方。","id":67,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"到处都是心怀不满的人，到处都是不知感恩的抱怨——仿佛那些无礼的军人闹得还不够似的，吵闹的平民也恨不得将圣骏堡翻个底朝天。","id":68,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2165_1#13$1","focus":"r","id":69},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"......","id":70,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f3/Avg_avg_npc_2165_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":71},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"哦，瞧我。你刚回来，恐怕还不知道。为近来这些事，我终日精神紧绷，多梦少眠，可见到老友的孩子，总归不该一上来就说这些。","id":72,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2165_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":73},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"......不会的，只要是您说的，我都愿意听。","id":74,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d4/Avg_avg_npc_2165_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":75},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"你是个好孩子，但现在却不是提这些事的好时候。","id":76,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"告诉我，娜塔申卡。你母亲身体还好吗？你父亲安德烈如今又在何处？","id":77,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"如果他来了圣骏堡，却没遣人告知于我，只让你来参加冬季舞会......","id":78,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"想来，应该是因为我们两家已经生分太久，我实在不算是个合格的朋友。","id":79,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2165_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":80},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"不是这样的，沃伦佐娃夫人。父亲曾说，如果能在这里见到您，就让我代他向您致意，请您宽恕他的久疏问候。","id":81,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_2165_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2165_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":82},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"至于母亲那边就更不必说了，您当然是她最要好的女友，可罗斯托夫家族如今必须想办法将中部仅剩的那些产业紧紧抓住。","id":83,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_2165_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2165_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":84},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"“我们切不可再丢失任何体面。”所以，非常遗憾......他们在短时间内都脱不开身。","id":85,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/07/Avg_avg_npc_2165_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":86},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"我了解了。但是孩子，你最后应该说的是：“所以，我就在这里了。”","id":87,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"看看你，已经是一个成熟体面的姑娘了，可以代表罗斯托夫家族了，不是吗？","id":88,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"我得说，你的仪态与教养，比许多生斯长斯的圣骏堡人都更为优秀——我相信用不了多久，圣骏堡会记住罗斯托夫这个姓氏的。","id":89,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2165_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":90},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"不......我很清楚自己还有许多要学的事务。","id":91,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/20/Avg_avg_npc_2165_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2165_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":92},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"说起这点，夫人，其实我很想向您请教，关于圣骏堡现在的局势......","id":93,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/20/Avg_avg_npc_2165_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":94},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"年轻的娜塔申卡，不要着急，我了解你的困惑，但这不是三言两语就能说清楚的问题。","id":95,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"你要学会用自己的眼睛去看，不会有比现在更好的机会了，你现在最应该做的就是——先好好享受这场冬季舞会。","id":96,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"在陛下到来之前，抛开那些恼人的问题、急于知道的答案，以及所有有关未来将会如何的奇谈怪论，只是享受当下。","id":97,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"去舞蹈，去嬉笑，去做年轻人应当做的事。","id":98,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"如果你看上某位青年军官，就算是那个老顽固博尔孔斯基家的，为了你母亲，我也会豁出这张老脸去替你说媒——","id":99,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"总之，在陛下的庇护下安宁地享乐，这是属于首都，属于我们这些忠诚的人的特权。","id":100,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"娜塔申卡，你必须先学会这点，才能真正融入其中。","id":101,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":102},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.1","fillto":"0.01","fadetime":"2","id":103},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.1","fillto":"0.01","fadetime":"2","id":104},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":105},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":106},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":107},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":108},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":109},{"type":"charslot","id":110},{"type":"curtain","id":111},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_bg_72_g2_sjbstreet_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":112},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":113},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":114},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$mist_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_mist_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":115,"musicid":1},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":116},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":117},{"type":"playsound","key":"$transmission","volume":"0.8","id":118},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“......你必须先学会这点，才能真正融入其中。”","multi":"true","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":119},{"type":"subtitle","id":120},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":121},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":122},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2156_1#2$1","id":123},{"type":"dialogue","name":"真理","text":"......矿工们仍在挨饿，哪怕是在圣骏堡，奥多耶夫区的居民也都已经用不起暖气，卡托加区更是在停工之后，被彻底切断了供电和供暖。","id":124,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/07/Avg_avg_npc_2156_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2156_1#2$1","id":125},{"type":"dialogue","name":"真理","text":"就算这样，他们也还是要享乐。","id":126,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/07/Avg_avg_npc_2156_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_196_sunbr_1#5$1","id":127},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古米","text":"我不明白......那个人不是说，陛下节省了皇宫的用电吗？那些省下来的能源呢？为什么——","id":128,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2e/Avg_avg_196_sunbr_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_194_leto_1#4$1","id":129},{"type":"dialogue","name":"烈夏","text":"这都聊的些什么乌七八糟的，“大人物”就是麻烦。","id":130,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2d/Avg_avg_194_leto_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_196_sunbr_1#21$1","id":131},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古米","text":"而且，早露姐一个人在里面，真的没关系吗？","id":132,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_avg_196_sunbr_1-21$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2156_1#11$1","id":133},{"type":"dialogue","name":"真理","text":"学生联合大会召开的前几天，娜塔莉娅就和我们商量了，她会以罗斯托夫家继承人的身份进入舞会，探查情报。","id":134,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ad/Avg_avg_npc_2156_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2156_1#8$1","id":135},{"type":"dialogue","name":"真理","text":"毕竟，总有些东西是只有贵族才知道，其他人都被蒙在鼓里的。无论是哪方面的情报，多掌握些总不会错。","id":136,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_npc_2156_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2156_1#8$1","id":137},{"type":"dialogue","name":"真理","text":"索尼娅相信她能做好，我也没有反对的理由。除了这些我们早就有所预料的对话内容，目前听起来还算顺利，监听设备的声音也算清晰。","id":138,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_npc_2156_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":139},{"type":"charslot","id":140},{"type":"avgdisplay","id":141,"style":"bg","name":"bg_black","afrom":"0","ato":"0.6","duration":"2","slot":"bgover","layer":"1","isblock":"true"},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":142},{"type":"interlude","maskid":"ui_cutin_mask_horizon","char":"伯塔尼","size":"1300,380","style":"2","offset":"0,20","channel":"3","isblock":"false","id":143},{"type":"1","channel":"3","slot":"m","sfrom":"1.25,1.25","sto":"1,1","sduration":"0.3","pfrom":"80,20","pto":"0,20","name":"cutin_char_23","duration":"6","isblock":"false","id":144},{"type":"2","channel":"3","name":"72_g3_podium","sfrom":"1.25,1.25","sto":"1.1,1.1","sduration":"0.3","pfrom":"100,20","pto":"0,20","duration":"5","isblock":"false","id":145},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":146},{"type":"dialogue","name":"烈夏","text":"得亏那位叫“伯塔尼”的学生，她的设备比想象中可靠。","id":147},{"type":"dialog","id":148},{"type":"interlude","channel":"3","clear":"true","id":149},{"type":"avgdisplay","id":150,"style":"bg","name":"bg_black","afrom":"0.6","ato":"0","duration":"0.7","slot":"bgover","layer":"1","block":"true"},{"type":"delay","time":"0.7","id":151},{"type":"avgdisplay","id":152},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2156_1#8$1","id":153},{"type":"dialogue","name":"真理","text":"接下来，我们只需要按计划配合示威行动就行。","id":154,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_npc_2156_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_196_sunbr_1#9$1","id":155},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古米","text":"凛冬姐好像在那边招手，我们该过去会合了！","id":156,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_196_sunbr_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2156_1#8$1","id":157},{"type":"dialogue","name":"真理","text":"应该是她已经和其他人沟通好了。我们收拾一下，这就过去。","id":158,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_npc_2156_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2156_1#4$1","id":159},{"type":"dialogue","name":"真理","text":"烈夏，你是留在这里还是？","id":160,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_2156_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_194_leto_1#7$1","id":161},{"type":"dialogue","name":"烈夏","text":"不，等下，先别说话。","id":162,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_194_leto_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_194_leto_1#7$1","id":163},{"type":"dialogue","name":"烈夏","text":"好像有情况......","id":164,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_194_leto_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":165},{"type":"dialog","id":166},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":167},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":168},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":169},{"type":"charslot","id":170},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_bg_72_g7_ballroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":171},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":172},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":173},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_ouat_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":174,"musicid":2},{"type":"dialogue","name":"担忧的贵族","text":"......我还以为，今年的冬季舞会不会举办了......","id":175},{"type":"dialogue","name":"担忧的贵族","text":"那群无礼的叛臣，竟敢矜仗武力威逼我们的皇帝陛下。可我也实在不知道，我们的陛下到底该拿他们怎样为好......","id":176},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骄傲的贵族","text":"越是这种时刻，我们越要挺起胸膛，继续必要的活动。陛下有这样的勇气，也有这样的远见。","id":177},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骄傲的贵族","text":"因为这是比什么举动都有力的反击，证明这动乱不足为惧，我们不会被已经失败过一次的叛徒击溃。","id":178},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骄傲的贵族","text":"至于那些看不清现状，选择支持叛乱者的家伙......我们只需要来年去他们的墓前，献上一束百合花。","id":179},{"type":"dialog","id":180},{"type":"charslot","id":181},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2165_1#4$1","id":182},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"......","id":183,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fd/Avg_avg_npc_2165_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2165_1#7$1","id":184},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"小心！","id":185,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avg_npc_2165_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":186},{"type":"charslot","id":187},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walkfast","volume":"1","id":188},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":189},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown3","volume":"1","id":190},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_splashwine","id":191},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2165_1#7$1","posfrom":"170,0","posto":"145,0","duration":"0.2","id":192},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2158_1#4$1","afrom":"1","ato":"1","posfrom":"210,0","posto":"30,0","duration":"0.6","focus":"l","id":193},{"type":"delay","time":"1.1","id":194},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2158_1#4$1","afrom":"1","ato":"1","posfrom":"30,0","posto":"10,0","duration":"0.5","focus":"l","id":195},{"type":"delay","time":"0.6","id":196},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":197},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"——抱歉——","id":198,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_2158_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":199},{"type":"charslot","id":200},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骄傲的贵族","text":"......先不论这位好心小姐的裙子，您的莽撞可是弄洒了一杯好酒，这位......不知名的先生。","id":201},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2158_1#10$1","id":202},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"抱歉，真的非常抱歉！请原谅我的无礼，沃尔金娜公爵阁下——","id":203,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/38/Avg_avg_npc_2158_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":204},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骄傲的贵族","text":"您没有冒犯到我，您现在更应当对这位被弄脏了裙子的小姐道歉。","id":205},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2158_1#4$1","id":206},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"呃，那这位......","id":207,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_2158_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2165_1#1$1","id":208},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"没关系。","id":209,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/20/Avg_avg_npc_2165_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":210},{"type":"charslot","id":211},{"type":"dialogue","name":"担忧的贵族","text":"是谁把这么冒失的家伙放进来了？","id":212},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骄傲的贵族","text":"他能被侍者放进来，总不会是什么籍籍无名的小市民。您的名字是？","id":213},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2158_1#1$1","id":214},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"哦！您可以叫我巴普洛维奇，下议院的一名小小议员，最近刚被陛下授予了枢密官官秩，是卡托加区近期事务的特别全权代表——","id":215,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_2158_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":216},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骄傲的贵族","text":"卡托加区的代表？啊，我想起来了。","id":217},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2158_1#6$1","id":218},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"您竟然记得我，这可真是无上的荣幸！","id":219,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_npc_2158_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":220},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骄傲的贵族","text":"当然，当然。我听说议会迟迟没有找到人选来处理卡托加区这个大麻烦，这份重任最后落在了您的头上，想必您一定有过人之处吧。","id":221},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骄傲的贵族","text":"如果不是我近来忙于为第二集团军调度冬季物资，一定会亲自派人上门祝贺。","id":222},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2158_1#2$1","id":223},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"公爵阁下实在是谬赞了......其实，我已经在卡托加区上任两个月了。","id":224,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_2158_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2158_1#2$1","id":225},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"我也不知道自己究竟是何德何能，会被委以重任，但的确不敢让陛下失望。","id":226,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_2158_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2158_1#2$1","id":227},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"您应该知道的，卡托加区并不如大家所说的那样一文不值，这个老工业区只是缺一个重新焕发生机的机会......","id":228,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_2158_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":229},{"type":"dialogue","name":"担忧的贵族","text":"（小声）我怎么没听说有这样一号人物？","id":230},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骄傲的贵族","text":"你在自己那奢华的庄园里休养了太久，不了解中枢人员变动也是常事。坐在花园摇椅里百无聊赖的时候，至少多看看报纸吧。","id":231},{"type":"dialogue","name":"担忧的贵族","text":"唉，看了也只是徒增烦扰。","id":232},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2158_1#1$1","id":233},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"不不......我实在不值得格利岑伯爵阁下劳神关注——我听说伯爵阁下的酒庄今年生意非常兴盛，想必您应该十分繁忙......","id":234,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_2158_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":235},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骄傲的贵族","text":"先不要急着献殷勤——您是不是还欠这位小姐一个正式的道歉？","id":236},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骄傲的贵族","text":"这位热心的小姐，您怎么称呼？","id":237},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2165_1#8$1","id":238},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"尊敬的公爵阁下，我叫娜塔莉娅·罗斯托娃。","id":239,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_2165_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":240},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骄傲的贵族","text":"罗斯托娃？这个姓氏倒是没怎么听说过......","id":241},{"type":"dialogue","name":"担忧的贵族","text":"我也没有。","id":242},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2158_1#1$1","id":243},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"哦！您的父亲一定就是切尔诺伯格的安德烈伯爵吧。","id":244,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_2158_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2165_1#6$1","id":245},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"没想到您竟然会知道家父......","id":246,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f5/Avg_avg_npc_2165_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2158_1#1$1","id":247},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"当然，您的父亲是个有远见的人，他及时从切城抽身而出，才不至于让全副身家都丢在那里——的确十分有智慧！","id":248,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_2158_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2165_1#13$1","id":249},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"......都已经是过去的事了。","id":250,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f3/Avg_avg_npc_2165_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":251},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骄傲的贵族","text":"没想到，巴普洛维奇先生，还真是......博闻强识。","id":252},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骄傲的贵族","text":"不过，还是先去换掉你的裙子吧，孩子。即使是再醇厚的美酒，也不是为了让绸缎品尝而酿造的。","id":253},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2165_1#3$1","id":254},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"好的，谢谢您......","id":255,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_avg_npc_2165_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":256},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_highheeledshoe_carpet_fts","volume":"1","id":257},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"60,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.8","block":"true","id":258},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":259},{"type":"text","text":"早露匆匆离开了这个令自己窘迫的场合，隐约还能听到身后人们热切的谈论。","id":260},{"type":"dialogue","name":"殷勤的声音","text":"沃尔金娜公爵阁下！我听说，您不支持将卡托加区全面停用的提议，当然，我也一样......","id":261},{"type":"dialogue","name":"殷勤的声音","text":"......这其中的产业，依然......","id":262},{"type":"dialogue","name":"殷勤的声音","text":"......也许我们能合作......","id":263},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":264},{"type":"dialog","id":265},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":266},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":267},{"type":"charslot","id":268},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_bg_72_g7_ballroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":269},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":270},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":271},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$darkness02_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_darkness02_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":272,"musicid":3},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2171_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":273},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1981_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":274},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的贵族","text":"......请注意你的措辞，梅利尼科夫先生。目前连陛下都还没有对远北事宜下定论。","id":275,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_npc_2171_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":276},{"type":"dialogue","name":"傲慢的贵族","text":"大人，您误会了我的意思，我刚才的话绝非是在对您或者女大公个人进行指责。","id":277,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dc/Avg_avg_npc_1981_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"傲慢的贵族","text":"只是，我早在叶莉萨维塔把远北搅得乌烟瘴气前，就已多次表达过对布列洁诺伊的担忧，而你们当时却齐声向陛下保证她的忠诚。","id":278,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dc/Avg_avg_npc_1981_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"傲慢的贵族","text":"所以是你们，你们老一派的每个人，都辜负了议会与陛下的信任。","id":279,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dc/Avg_avg_npc_1981_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":280},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的贵族","text":"那就期盼你在听证会上也能如此慷慨陈词，最好一字不改，让所有人知道，你如何妄言乌萨斯的基石们。","id":281,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_npc_2171_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":282},{"type":"dialogue","name":"傲慢的贵族","text":"不必等到那个时候，大人。","id":283,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dc/Avg_avg_npc_1981_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"傲慢的贵族","text":"今晚皇帝陛下莅临会场，我一定会向他本人痛诉你们的罪行！","id":284,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dc/Avg_avg_npc_1981_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":285},{"type":"charslot","id":286},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walkfast","id":287},{"type":"delay","time":"0.8","id":288},{"type":"text","text":"怒叱声惹来了在场许多人的目光，几位侍从赶忙上前，试图平息大人物不知因何而起的怒火。","id":289},{"type":"dialog","id":290},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2165_1#4$1","focus":"n","id":291},{"type":"text","text":"早露拢了拢衣袖，稍稍驱散寒意，尽管舞会厅的壁炉比乌萨斯任何一处都烧得更热，暖气也终日供应着。","id":292},{"type":"text","text":"一旁的侍从正在更换香薰，浓郁的佛手柑与橙花的气味，遮掩住酒精挥发的辛辣，早露长吁一口气。","id":293},{"type":"dialog","id":294},{"type":"charslot","id":295},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2165_1#4$1","id":296},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":297},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2173_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":298},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":299},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":300},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"你还好吗，娜塔申卡？还是没有找到合适的聊天人选？","id":301,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"哦天哪，你的裙子——是谁轻慢你了吗？把那人的名字告诉我，我一定狠狠给他一个教训！","id":302,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2165_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":303},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"不是的，夫人，您实在不必为此生气。这是我帮助了一位女士所留下的“勋章”呢。","id":304,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_2165_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":305},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"你是个热心的孩子，但答应我，下次先保证自己的安全，好吗？谁知道那些谄媚的家伙会做出什么事。","id":306,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2165_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":307},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"感谢您的关心，可这算得上是今晚头等有趣的好事了。","id":308,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/20/Avg_avg_npc_2165_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2165_1#12$1","focus":"r","id":309},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"今晚我所听到的大都与那位女大公有关。我试着去了解，去询问，却始终因为对这类话题缺乏必要的知识，导致对话无法进行下去。","id":310,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ed/Avg_avg_npc_2165_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":311},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"这就是你父母让你来到圣骏堡的作用了，我亲爱的娜塔申卡。","id":312,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"我见过许多年轻的小姐，宁可把灵魂托付给厨师、裁缝和医生，也不愿分神给那些制定法律、平定叛乱、敲定赋税的伟人......","id":313,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"即使是他们始终在照看着我们。","id":314,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2165_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":315},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"您说的道理，我都明白，可我如今只是一个中部小伯爵的继承人，又怎么会得到这些人在百忙之中才会抽出空来的注视呢？","id":316,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/07/Avg_avg_npc_2165_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":317},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"......你是我老友的独生女，我必须得把话讲得更明白。","id":318,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"没有人能脱离政治而生存，尤其你承袭了贵族的头衔，它已经赋予了你沉重的责任。","id":319,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2165_1#14$1","focus":"r","id":320},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"这样的责任，是通过在这里轻松地谈论一些事物就能实现的吗......","id":321,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7c/Avg_avg_npc_2165_1-14$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":322},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"娜塔申卡......","id":323,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"你误解了我们在这里高谈阔论的缘由。这些话语并不是为了宣告一定会被落实的举措，也不是为了表明我们真正的意见。","id":324,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2165_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":325},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"那是为了......什么呢？","id":326,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_npc_2165_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":327},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"为了合群，孩子。为了迅速与一些人划清界限，又与另一些人结为同盟。","id":328,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"一份签名文件，或许就能让你的父母东山再起，让你的儿女远离战壕，让你的朋友都在庄园里安稳入眠。","id":329,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"不要以为沉浸享乐就能逃离他们的目光，这只会让他们照看你的方式变得粗暴，且不容置疑。","id":330,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"真正高效的社交场合就是这样运作的，我的娜塔申卡。","id":331,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2165_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":332},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"......看来我要学习的还有很多。","id":333,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/20/Avg_avg_npc_2165_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":334},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"所幸，年轻人最不缺的就是时间了。","id":335,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":336},{"type":"charslot","id":337},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_woodfloor_fts","volume":"1","id":338},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":339},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1981_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":340},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2171_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":341},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贵族A","text":"（低声）是议长阁下——","id":342,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dc/Avg_avg_npc_1981_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":343},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贵族B","text":"还有瓦西里副议长！真稀奇，他们几乎不在议会之外的地方一同出现......","id":344,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_npc_2171_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":345},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贵族A","text":"议长阁下很少参加舞会，但陛下还迟迟没有驾临......这，是否是某种信号？","id":346,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dc/Avg_avg_npc_1981_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":347},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贵族B","text":"也许是想安抚我们。","id":348,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_npc_2171_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":349},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贵族A","text":"那恐怕来得有些晚了。","id":350,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dc/Avg_avg_npc_1981_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":351},{"type":"charslot","id":352},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":353},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2173_1#1$1","id":354},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"......","id":355,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2165_1#6$1","id":356},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"那两位......？","id":357,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f5/Avg_avg_npc_2165_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":358},{"type":"charslot","id":359},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":360},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2162_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":361},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1984_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":362},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crowdtalk_fear","loop":"true","channel":"a","volume":"0","id":363},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"a","fadetime":"2","text":"","id":364},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":365},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"n","id":366},{"type":"text","text":"在二人到来的第一时间，整个舞会的目光都聚集在了他们身上。人们自动为两人的到来分出一条道路，通向舞会厅的正中央。","id":367},{"type":"text","text":"人群中发出声音响亮但不知情绪真假的问候。","id":368},{"type":"dialog","id":369},{"type":"charslot","id":370},{"type":"avgdisplay","id":371,"style":"bg","name":"bg_black","afrom":"0","ato":"0.6","duration":"2","slot":"bgover","layer":"1","isblock":"true"},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":372},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2172_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","duration":"1","focus":"n","id":373},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2171_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","duration":"1","focus":"n","id":374},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":375},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“我们敬爱的议长阁下，向您致敬。”","x":"300","y":"350","multi":"true","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":376},{"type":"subtitle","id":377},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":378},{"type":"charslot","id":379},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2169_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","duration":"1","focus":"n","id":380},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“尊敬的副议长阁下，祝您身体健康。”","x":"300","y":"350","multi":"true","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":381},{"type":"subtitle","id":382},{"type":"charslot","id":383},{"type":"subtitle","text":"......","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":384},{"type":"subtitle","id":385},{"type":"avgdisplay","id":386,"style":"bg","name":"bg_black","afrom":"0.6","ato":"0","duration":"1","slot":"bgover","layer":"1","block":"true"},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":387},{"type":"avgdisplay","id":388},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2165_1#10$1","duration":"1","id":389},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":390},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":391},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.5","channel":"a","fadetime":"2","text":"","id":392},{"type":"text","text":"早露挤在人群中，小心地打量起二人。","id":393},{"type":"dialog","id":394},{"type":"charslot","id":395},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_woodfloor_fts","volume":"1","id":396},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1984_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":397},{"type":"delay","time":"1.8","id":398},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1984_1#1$1","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1","id":399},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":400},{"type":"text","text":"黑发的男人沉默地从人群中走过，脸上不见喜怒，眼神坚定却难掩疲惫，只是看向空无一物的前方。","id":401},{"type":"dialog","id":402},{"type":"charslot","id":403},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_woodfloor_fts","volume":"0.6","id":404},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2162_1#2$1","duration":"1","id":405},{"type":"delay","time":"1.8","id":406},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2162_1#2$1","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1","id":407},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":408},{"type":"text","text":"被称为“副议长”的男人走在明显矮他一头的黑发男人身后，恭敬地维持着半个身位的距离，同时以温和的笑容向人们点头致意。","id":409},{"type":"dialog","id":410},{"type":"charslot","id":411},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"a","fadetime":"2","id":412},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2173_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":413},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2165_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":414},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"......金发的那位，是瓦西里·戈尔奇科夫公爵，近卫军荣誉上将，也是帝国议会的常务副议长。","id":415,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"（低声）而走在他前面，黑发的那位——","id":416,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2165_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":417},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"伊斯拉姆·维特议长。","id":418,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/20/Avg_avg_npc_2165_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":419},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"是了......每个立足在圣骏堡的人都不该不认识他。","id":420,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2165_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":421},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"不，夫人，是我在城际网络上看过他演讲的视频。《在图利斯卡亚特别技术学校落成仪式上的演说》，内容简洁真挚，令人印象深刻。","id":422,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/eb/Avg_avg_npc_2165_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":423},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"哦，城际网络......我可能永远也弄不清这些时髦玩意。","id":424,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"去吧，娜塔申卡，到他们跟前去。去听听那些人都在说些什么，这也是学习的好时机。","id":425,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2165_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":426},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"好的，夫人。那么，我这就——","id":427,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/20/Avg_avg_npc_2165_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":428},{"type":"charslot","id":429},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":430},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_phntsmglsbrek","volume":"1","id":431},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":432},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crwddiscuss_inside","volume":"0","channel":"f","loop":"true","id":433},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.8","channel":"f","fadetime":"2","id":434},{"type":"text","text":"清脆的玻璃破碎声响，在舞会厅各处愉悦的高谈阔论中显得如此刺耳，人们不禁寻找它的源头。","id":435},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1981_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":436},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2171_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":437},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贵族A","text":"奥萨奇伯爵，您身体有什么不适吗？","id":438,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dc/Avg_avg_npc_1981_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":439},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贵族B","text":"......不，不不，是他们来了，他们在楼下！","id":440,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_npc_2171_1$1.png"},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_spotlightc","volume":"1","id":441},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":442},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":443},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_paniccrowd","volume":"0.7","id":444},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贵族A","text":"什么？哪个天杀的把电闸关了——难道是停电了？","id":445,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_npc_2171_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贵族B","text":"不，皇宫怎么会突然停电？肯定是暴民——","id":446,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_npc_2171_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":447},{"type":"charslot","id":448},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_recorderglitch","volume":"1","id":449},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.5","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":450},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":451},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.5","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":452},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":453},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.8","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":454},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":455},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"f","fadetime":"2","id":456},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1981_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":457},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2171_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":458},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贵族A","text":"皇宫的勤务官就是这么办事的吗，连个电闸都维护不好——","id":459,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dc/Avg_avg_npc_1981_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":460},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贵族B","text":"......快看外面！","id":461,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_npc_2171_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贵族B","text":"真的有暴民，还正在我们的窗外！","id":462,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_npc_2171_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":463},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":464},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":465},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":466},{"type":"charslot","id":467},{"type":"background","id":468},{"type":"image","id":469}],"characters":["早露","殷勤的近侍","贵族女性","沃伦佐娃夫人","真理","古米","烈夏","担忧的贵族","骄傲的贵族","？？？","巴普洛维奇","殷勤的声音","严肃的贵族","傲慢的贵族","贵族A","贵族B"]}